6	1360	ar	3404	ما هي تكلفة الاشتراك في أسطول؟	أسطول يقدم باقات مرنة بأسعار اقتصادية، سواء شهرية أو سنوية، لتناسب احتياجات شركتك وميزانيتك.	68d168c626cdeade3ad8ad72
1	1383	en	3537	What is Ostool?	Ostool is an integrated cloud-based system that helps car rental companies, dealerships, and logistics providers manage all their operations from one secure platform.	68d1673432b02982027aa6b4
2	1383	en	3538	Does Ostool support e-invoicing and VAT compliance?	Absolutely. Ostool is fully compliant with ZATCA requirements, supporting e-invoicing and VAT to keep your business aligned with regulations.	68d1674432b02982027aa6b5
3	1383	en	3539	Is the system suitable for small businesses or only large enterprises?	Ostool is flexible and customizable, making it ideal for businesses of all sizes—from small rental showrooms to large logistics companies.	68d1676b32b02982027aa6b6
4	1383	en	3540	How does Ostool ensure data security?	Ostool uses advanced encryption protocols and high-level security standards to protect your business data and customer records from breaches or loss.	68d1678a32b02982027aa6b7
5	1383	en	3541	Does the system provide financial and operational reports?	Yes, Ostool generates accurate, real-time reports on sales, revenues, maintenance, and overall performance to help you make data-driven decisions.	68ca6d5c77d42aacfd0aadbc
6	1383	en	3542	What is the subscription cost for Ostool?	Ostool offers flexible and cost-effective pricing plans, both monthly and annually.	68d167c332b02982027aa6b8
\.
