2	10	en	13	Information We Collect	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Based on our terms of service, we collect the following information from authorized users accessing our Services:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"tag": "ul", "type": "list", "start": 1, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "listitem", "value": 1, "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Account Information", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ": When creating a user account, we may collect the username, password, full name, email address, and other relevant information about the user's company (\\"Account Information\\").", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 1}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 2, "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Usage Data", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ": We may collect information about how users interact with our Services, including the type of device they use, the duration of their usage, the pages they visit, and the information they search for (\\"Usage Data\\").", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 1}], "listType": "bullet", "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": "ltr"}}	68c9d4549ed6bc72e9391a4a
1	11	en	14	Introduction	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "This privacy policy (\\"Policy\\") outlines how Nafes (\\"the company\\", \\"we\\", \\"our\\", or \\"us\\") collects, uses, and discloses your personal information when you use our service platform (\\"Services\\").", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": "ltr"}}	68c9d3b89ed6bc72e9391a44
2	11	en	15	Information We Collect	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Based on our terms of service, we collect the following information from authorized users accessing our Services:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"tag": "ul", "type": "list", "start": 1, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "listitem", "value": 1, "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Account Information", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ": When creating a user account, we may collect the username, password, full name, email address, and other relevant information about the user's company (\\"Account Information\\").", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 1}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 2, "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Usage Data", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ": We may collect information about how users interact with our Services, including the type of device they use, the duration of their usage, the pages they visit, and the information they search for (\\"Usage Data\\").", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 1}], "listType": "bullet", "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": "ltr"}}	68c9d4549ed6bc72e9391a4a
2	232	ar	429	نقاط رئيسية:	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"tag": "ol", "type": "list", "start": 1, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "listitem", "value": 1, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "جمع البيانات:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": "rtl", "textFormat": 1}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 2, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"tag": "ul", "type": "list", "start": 1, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "listitem", "value": 1, "format": "", "indent": 1, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "المعلومات التي تقدمها عند التسجيل، التواصل، أو استخدام الخدمات مثل الاسم، البريد الإلكتروني، رقم الهاتف، وغيرها.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "rtl"}], "listType": "bullet", "direction": "rtl"}], "direction": null}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 2, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "استخدام البيانات:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": "rtl", "textFormat": 1}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 3, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"tag": "ul", "type": "list", "start": 1, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "listitem", "value": 1, "format": "", "indent": 1, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "تقديم الخدمات، الدعم الفني، والتحسين المستمر للموقع.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "rtl"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 2, "format": "", "indent": 1, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "إرسال رسائل إعلامية أو تحديثات حول الخدمات إذا وافقت على استلامها.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "rtl"}], "listType": "bullet", 