1	45	version.layout	en	2	Nafes Platform Terms and Conditions	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "1. ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Subscriptions", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "1.1 The Company shall sell to the Customer the number of subscriptions specified in the Order Form, enabling the Customer and its employees to access and benefit from all services available on the Nafes Platform.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "1.2 Nafes Account: The Customer will be required to create an account to access the services (“", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Nafes Account", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "”). To properly create a Nafes Account, the Customer must:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"tag": "ul", "type": "list", "start": 1, "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "listitem", "value": 1, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Ensure that the Nafes Account is created by authorized personnel of the Customer and that all required information is provided to meet the subscription requirements; and", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 2, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Provide the Company with true, accurate, and complete information about the Customer and maintain the accuracy and completeness of this information at all times.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}], "listType": "bullet", "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "2. ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Nafes Responsibilities", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Nafes shall:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"tag": "ul", "type": "list", "start": 1, "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "listitem", "value": 1, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Provide services to the Customer in accordance with the applicable laws of the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, these Terms and Conditions, and the Order Form;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 2, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "During the Subscription Term, use commercially reasonable efforts to ensure the continuous operation of the Nafes Platform as outlined in this Terms and Conditions. The Platform may be temporarily unavailable due to scheduled maintenance, unscheduled emergency maintenance by the Company or third-party providers, or due to causes beyond the Company’s reasonable direct control. However, the Company will use reasonable efforts to notify the Customer in advance via email of any scheduled downtime;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 3, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Provide the Nafes Platform on an “as is” and “as available” basis, without any warranties or representations of any kind, whether express or implied, except as explicitly stated in these Terms and Conditions;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 4, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Not guarantee that the Nafes Platform is free of viruses or other harmful components, or that it will be uninterrupted or error-free, or that its features will operate in conjunction with other software, hardware, or systems, or be immune to hacking or unauthorized access by third parties; and", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 5, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Use its best commercial efforts to provide support to the Customer as outlined in these Terms and Conditions and the Order Form.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}], "listType": "bullet", "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "3. Customer Responsibilities", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "The Customer shall:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"tag": "ul", "type": "list", "start": 1, "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "listitem", "value": 1, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Pay the subscription fees as specified in the Order Form;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 2, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Acknowledge that Nafes merely aggregates and displays tenders and competitions announced in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia as received from their respective sources and does not provide any technical and/or professional advice regarding any tender/competition listed on the Nafes Platform;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 3, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Acknowledge that the AI-powered services available on the Nafes Platform are intended solely to assist and guide the Customer and its employees in locating and analyzing tenders/competitions and are not to be construed as technical and/or professional advice. The Customer agrees not to rely on the analyses or outputs from the Platform for making any decisions related to such tenders or competitions;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 4, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Use the Nafes Platform solely for the purpose of reviewing and evaluating tenders/competitions announced in Saudi Arabia and shall not engage in reverse engineering, decompiling, disassembling, translating, or attempting to discover the source code or underlying ideas of the software, nor copy or reproduce any content or use it to create competing products or services;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 5, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Not replicate, modify, publish, transmit, distribute, or otherwise exploit any part of the Nafes Platform by any means;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 6, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Not access the Nafes Platform for the purpose of developing or offering a competing platform or service;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 7, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Be solely responsible for its use of the services and for any access to the Nafes Platform;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 8, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Not transfer, sublicense, lease, resell, or make the Platform accessible, even temporarily, to unauthorized users or third parties without prior written consent from the Company;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 9, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Use commercially reasonable efforts to prevent unauthorized access and promptly notify Nafes of any unauthorized use or access;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 10, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Acknowledge that the Nafes Platform is provided “as is” and that the Company shall not be liable for the Customer's or its employees' inability to access or use the Platform due to circumstances beyond the Company’s direct and full control, including but not limited to those involving internet service or telecom providers.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}], "listType": "bullet", "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "4. Term, Termination, and Suspension", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"tag": "ul", "type": "list", "start": 1, "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "listitem", "value": 1, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Term", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ":", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " The subscription term is one (1) calendar year starting from the Effective Date specified in the Order Form (“", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Subscription Term", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "”) and will automatically renew for successive terms unless either party notifies the other in writing of its intent not to renew at least two (2) months prior to the expiration of the then-current term.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 8}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 2, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Termination for Material Breach", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ":", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " Either party may terminate the Subscription Term upon written notice if the other party materially breaches this Terms and Conditions and fails to cure such breach within ten (10) business days of receiving written notice thereof.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 8}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 3, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Termination for Insolvency", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ":", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " Either party may immediately terminate the Subscription Term by written notice in the event the other party is liquidated, dissolved, files for bankruptcy, makes an assignment for the benefit of creditors, or ceases business operations.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 8}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 4, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Termination for Unlawful Use of Nafes Platform", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ":", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " The Company may terminate the Subscription immediately without notice if the Client uses the Platform or services for any unlawful or prohibited purpose, including but not limited to unauthorized use of source code or any attempt to harm, disrupt, or compete with the Company or the Nafes Platform.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 8}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 5, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Subscription Suspension", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ":", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " The Company may suspend the Customer’s access to the Nafes Platform immediately upon the Customer’s failure to pay any due amounts, breach of any part of this Terms and Conditions, or involvement in unlawful activities that may harm the Company.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 8}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 6, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Effect of Termination or Suspension", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ":", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " Termination or suspension does not relieve the Client of its obligations accrued up to the effective date thereof. Upon such termination or suspension:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 8}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 7, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"tag": "ul", "type": "list", "start": 1, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "listitem", "value": 1, "format": "", "indent": 1, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "All rights and subscriptions granted to the Client shall immediately cease;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 2, "format": "", "indent": 1, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "The Client must pay all outstanding dues within forty-eight (48) hours, and acknowledges that any fees already paid are non-refundable.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}], "listType": "bullet", "direction": "ltr"}], "direction": "ltr"}], "listType": "bullet", "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "5 ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Fees and Payment Terms", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "5.1", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " Fees:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " The Client agrees to pay the subscription fees specified in the Order Form (“", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Fees", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "”).", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "5.2 ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Taxes", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ": Fees are exclusive of any applicable taxes, including VAT and other government-imposed charges, which shall be borne by the Client.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "5.3 ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Payment Terms:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " Unless otherwise stated in the Order Form, all fees are payable in advance in a single lump sum upon signing the Order Form.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "5.4 ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Fee Adjustment:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " The fees stated are fixed during the initial Subscription Term. The Company may revise fees for any renewal term by providing written notice at least one (1) month before the current term expires. The Client may accept the new fees or notify the Company at least fourteen (14) days prior to the renewal date if it chooses not to renew.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "6", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Force Majeure", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Neither party shall be liable for any delay or failure in performance due to a force majeure event. Each party must notify the other promptly upon becoming aware of such an event. If the event continues for more than sixty (60) days, either party may terminate this Terms and Conditions without further liability, except for accrued obligations.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "7", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Intellectual Property", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "7.1 The Customer acknowledges and agrees that all intellectual property rights in the Nafes Platform and services belong solely to the Company or its licensors. No rights are granted to the Client other than as explicitly stated herein.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "7.2 The Customer agrees to indemnify the Company, its licensors, and affiliates against all claims, damages, or costs resulting from the infringement or alleged infringement of intellectual property rights arising from the Customer’s or its users’ use of the Nafes Platform.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": "ltr"}}	68c9d8ea1df3ee7929530474	\N
1	46	version.layout	en	3	Nafes Platform Terms and Conditions	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "1. ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Subscriptions", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "1.1 The Company shall sell to the Customer the number of subscriptions specified in the Order Form, enabling the Customer and its employees to access and benefit from all services available on the Nafes Platform.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "1.2 Nafes Account: The Customer will be required to create an account to access the services (“", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Nafes Account", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "”). To properly create a Nafes Account, the Customer must:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"tag": "ul", "type": "list", "start": 1, "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "listitem", "value": 1, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Ensure that the Nafes Account is created by authorized personnel of the Customer and that all required information is provided to meet the subscription requirements; and", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 2, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Provide the Company with true, accurate, and complete information about the Customer and maintain the accuracy and completeness of this information at all times.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}], "listType": "bullet", "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "2. ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Nafes Responsibilities", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Nafes shall:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"tag": "ul", "type": "list", "start": 1, "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "listitem", "value": 1, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Provide services to the Customer in accordance with the applicable laws of the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, these Terms and Conditions, and the Order Form;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 2, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "During the Subscription Term, use commercially reasonable efforts to ensure the continuous operation of the Nafes Platform as outlined in this Terms and Conditions. The Platform may be temporarily unavailable due to scheduled maintenance, unscheduled emergency maintenance by the Company or third-party providers, or due to causes beyond the Company’s reasonable direct control. However, the Company will use reasonable efforts to notify the Customer in advance via email of any scheduled downtime;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 3, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Provide the Nafes Platform on an “as is” and “as available” basis, without any warranties or representations of any kind, whether express or implied, except as explicitly stated in these Terms and Conditions;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 4, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Not guarantee that the Nafes Platform is free of viruses or other harmful components, or that it will be uninterrupted or error-free, or that its features will operate in conjunction with other software, hardware, or systems, or be immune to hacking or unauthorized access by third parties; and", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 5, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Use its best commercial efforts to provide support to the Customer as outlined in these Terms and Conditions and the Order Form.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}], "listType": "bullet", "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "3. Customer Responsibilities", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "The Customer shall:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"tag": "ul", "type": "list", "start": 1, "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "listitem", "value": 1, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Pay the subscription fees as specified in the Order Form;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 2, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Acknowledge that Nafes merely aggregates and displays tenders and competitions announced in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia as received from their respective sources and does not provide any technical and/or professional advice regarding any tender/competition listed on the Nafes Platform;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 3, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Acknowledge that the AI-powered services available on the Nafes Platform are intended solely to assist and guide the Customer and its employees in locating and analyzing tenders/competitions and are not to be construed as technical and/or professional advice. The Customer agrees not to rely on the analyses or outputs from the Platform for making any decisions related to such tenders or competitions;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 4, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Use the Nafes Platform solely for the purpose of reviewing and evaluating tenders/competitions announced in Saudi Arabia and shall not engage in reverse engineering, decompiling, disassembling, translating, or attempting to discover the source code or underlying ideas of the software, nor copy or reproduce any content or use it to create competing products or services;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 5, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Not replicate, modify, publish, transmit, distribute, or otherwise exploit any part of the Nafes Platform by any means;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 6, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Not access the Nafes Platform for the purpose of developing or offering a competing platform or service;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 7, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Be solely responsible for its use of the services and for any access to the Nafes Platform;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 8, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Not transfer, sublicense, lease, resell, or make the Platform accessible, even temporarily, to unauthorized users or third parties without prior written consent from the Company;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 9, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Use commercially reasonable efforts to prevent unauthorized access and promptly notify Nafes of any unauthorized use or access;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 10, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Acknowledge that the Nafes Platform is provided “as is” and that the Company shall not be liable for the Customer's or its employees' inability to access or use the Platform due to circumstances beyond the Company’s direct and full control, including but not limited to those involving internet service or telecom providers.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}], "listType": "bullet", "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "4. Term, Termination, and Suspension", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"tag": "ul", "type": "list", "start": 1, "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "listitem", "value": 1, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Term", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ":", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " The subscription term is one (1) calendar year starting from the Effective Date specified in the Order Form (“", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Subscription Term", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "”) and will automatically renew for successive terms unless either party notifies the other in writing of its intent not to renew at least two (2) months prior to the expiration of the then-current term.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 8}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 2, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Termination for Material Breach", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ":", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " Either party may terminate the Subscription Term upon written notice if the other party materially breaches this Terms and Conditions and fails to cure such breach within ten (10) business days of receiving written notice thereof.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 8}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 3, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Termination for Insolvency", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ":", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " Either party may immediately terminate the Subscription Term by written notice in the event the other party is liquidated, dissolved, files for bankruptcy, makes an assignment for the benefit of creditors, or ceases business operations.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 8}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 4, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Termination for Unlawful Use of Nafes Platform", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ":", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " The Company may terminate the Subscription immediately without notice if the Client uses the Platform or services for any unlawful or prohibited purpose, including but not limited to unauthorized use of source code or any attempt to harm, disrupt, or compete with the Company or the Nafes Platform.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 8}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 5, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Subscription Suspension", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ":", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " The Company may suspend the Customer’s access to the Nafes Platform immediately upon the Customer’s failure to pay any due amounts, breach of any part of this Terms and Conditions, or involvement in unlawful activities that may harm the Company.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 8}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 6, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Effect of Termination or Suspension", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ":", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " Termination or suspension does not relieve the Client of its obligations accrued up to the effective date thereof. Upon such termination or suspension:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 8}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 7, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"tag": "ul", "type": "list", "start": 1, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "listitem", "value": 1, "format": "", "indent": 1, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "All rights and subscriptions granted to the Client shall immediately cease;", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 2, "format": "", "indent": 1, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "The Client must pay all outstanding dues within forty-eight (48) hours, and acknowledges that any fees already paid are non-refundable.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}], "listType": "bullet", "direction": "ltr"}], "direction": "ltr"}], "listType": "bullet", "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "5 ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Fees and Payment Terms", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "5.1", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " Fees:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " The Client agrees to pay the subscription fees specified in the Order Form (“", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Fees", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "”).", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "5.2 ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Taxes", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ": Fees are exclusive of any applicable taxes, including VAT and other government-imposed charges, which shall be borne by the Client.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "5.3 ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Payment Terms:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " Unless otherwise stated in the Order Form, all fees are payable in advance in a single lump sum upon signing the Order Form.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "5.4 ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Fee Adjustment:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " The fees stated are fixed during the initial Subscription Term. The Company may revise fees for any renewal term by providing written notice at least one (1) month before the current term expires. The Client may accept the new fees or notify the Company at least fourteen (14) days prior to the renewal date if it chooses not to renew.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "6", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Force Majeure", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Neither party shall be liable for any delay or failure in performance due to a force majeure event. Each party must notify the other promptly upon becoming aware of such an event. If the event continues for more than sixty (60) days, either party may terminate this Terms and Conditions without further liability, except for accrued obligations.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "7", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Intellectual Property", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "7.1 The Customer acknowledges and agrees that all intellectual property rights in the Nafes Platform and services belong solely to the Company or its licensors. No rights are granted to the Client other than as explicitly stated herein.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "start", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "7.2 The Customer agrees to indemnify the Company, its licensors, and affiliates against all claims, damages, or costs resulting from the infringement or alleged infringement of intellectual property rights arising from the Customer’s or its users’ use of the Nafes Platform.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": "ltr"}}	68c9d8ea1df3ee7929530474	\N
