COPY public.job_applications_locales (full_name, email, country, "position", gulf_experience, id, _locale, _parent_id, availability) FROM stdin;
Ahmed Ashraf	ahmed.ashraf.p7@gmail.com	Egypt	Product Owner	I haven’t worked directly in the Gulf market before, but I have solid experience working with cloud-based systems and web platforms that support distributed teams. My focus has always been on improving usability, reliability, and scalability, which are all key aspects of SaaS products like Ostool. I’m very interested in the logistics and fleet-management domain and eager to apply my technical and product experience in that context.	7	en	7	1 week notice period from the offer reception's date
Belal Bahr	belaltbahr@gmail.com	Egypt	Product Owner	My cloud-based systems experience comes from two roles. At Microsoft, I spent 13 months working on Dynamics 365 F&O Supply Chain Management, an enterprise cloud ERP with multi-tenant architecture. I worked on supply chain workflows including inventory tracking, warehouse management, and logistics, using Azure DevOps and Power Platform for customization and integration. I translated complex operational requirements into technical specs for distributed teams. Some of my clients were based in Gulf Countries, including but not limited to Saudi Arabia, Qatar, and UAE. Fleet management shares structural similarities with supply chain systems: asset tracking, utilization optimization, and compliance reporting.\r\n\r\nCurrently at Scalicx, I'm leading the product transformation of an RFID automation platform from single-tenant to multi-factory SaaS. I'm defining the architecture for a configurable, scalable B2B platform while managing product development for operations-heavy manufacturing customers. The work involves asset tracking, reporting, and compliance needs similar to fleet operations, though in a different vertical. Working with constrained engineering resources has forced ruthless prioritization discipline.	8	en	8	26/11/2025
Sara Magdi Abbas	saraabbas.sobeih@gmail.com	Egypt	Product Owner	None	10	en	10	Now
Ahmed Omar	AhmedOmar042@gmail.com	Egypt	Product Owner	I have over 4 years of technical experience in mobile application development, along with 3 years of experience working as a Business Analyst, which allows me to bridge the gap effectively between business goals and technical execution.	12	en	12	15 days
عبدالله منصور حوذان الجابري	abdullahhm77i@gmail.com	Saudi Arabia	موظف استقبال صيانه - موظف مكتب تأجير	لا أمتلك خبره كافيه لكن عملت في الوفاق لصيانه السيارات بمسمى موظف استقبال صيانه وايضاً عملت في فحص وتشخيص السيارات	13	en	13	فوراً
