1	68c9c95fca1e8fa229a22a01	en	68c9c9bfca1e8fa229a22a03	20	Fleet Management	An all-in-one system to manage your vehicles, including operations, contracts, maintenance, and invoicing — all from a single platform.
2	68c9c95fca1e8fa229a22a01	en	68d15f8632b02982027aa69c	22	Maintenance Management	A complete maintenance record for every vehicle with automated alerts to reduce breakdowns and ensure fleet readiness.
3	68c9c95fca1e8fa229a22a01	en	68d15fbf32b02982027aa69d	24	Booking Management	Seamless organization of rental requests and reservations with real-time tracking.
