1	68d1644f32b02982027aa6aa	en	68d1647232b02982027aa6ab	39	Easy-to-Use Interface	Ostool is designed to be simple and practical, enabling your team to manage car rentals and logistics services without complexity or long training.
2	68d1644f32b02982027aa6aa	en	68d1649d32b02982027aa6ac	40	Regulatory Compliance	Ostool supports e-invoicing and VAT requirements, and adheres to the latest regulations, making it the perfect solution for car rental companies and logistics providers.
