 use, high level of security, and extensive customization capabilities that allow each company to tailor the system to suit its business needs.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Osṭool was designed as an integrated cloud-based system specialized in managing car rental companies and providing logistical solutions. This is made possible by a highly experienced and professional development team. The system relies on the latest cloud technologies, enabling fleet owners to have full control over fleet management, reservations, maintenance, contracts, customers, and even employees, in addition to generating reports and analyzing financial performance.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "It also stands out for its full customization capability based on business requirements, a feature that gives it a competitive edge over many other systems in the Arab market.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"tag": "h2", "type": "heading", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Markaba System", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Markaba", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " is a cloud-based solution provided by ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Sarab Company", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " and is considered one of the best available systems in the Kingdom. It specifically targets car rental companies in the Saudi market. The system provides essential tools for business management, such as contract management, maintenance, fleet management, payment operations, and reservations.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"tag": "h2", "type": "heading", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Daftra", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr"}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"id": "696cce7b8ad09601022276fe", "type": "link", "fields": {"url": "https://www.daftra.com/en", "newTab": true, "linkType": "custom"}, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 3, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Daftra", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textFormat": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": " is one of the leading companies in providing administrative and accounting solutions, including a car rental management system as part of its service offerings. The system allows users to create invoices, manage rental contracts, and track customers, in addition to advanced accounting tools.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Daftra is suitable for companies looking for a so